# Force LF for shell scripts regardless of the cloning machine's core.autocrlf
# setting. On Windows (autocrlf=true), init.sh was silently rewritten to CRLF
# on a routine `git clone`/checkout, which bash inside the Linux container
# can't parse ("$'\r': command not found") — it only surfaced once the
# container restarted and re-read the file from the bind-mounted host folder.
*.sh text eol=lf
